### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

###
### Submit a chat job
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "system": "You are an amazing AI",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Hej" }
  ]
}

###
### Stream tokens (NDJSON). Replace :id with the key from POST.
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/messages/1/tokens

###
### Final status / full content
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/messages/1

###
### Cancel a job
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/messages/1
